      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIR EASY (1) boasts a consistent overall record including four wins from nine starts, the latest winning (30.83) over 530m at Angle Park. Tends to go well on this box draw. Has the inside draw and looks tough to beat. PAW CHRISTIE (2) jumped from an outside draw but scored by 1.75 lengths (24.17) at Bendigo in Grade 5. Failed to fire only run here. Won at her only start from this draw. Deserves serious consideration again. LOCO BOOM (3) is having his first look at this course. In the money last start when third (30.40) at Richmond over 520m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Must be included in calculations. CRACKERJACK TREV (7) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
